    {
      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "לא לנו...לא לנו",
      "rationale": "Kũrĩnganĩrwa kwĩhĩtia kuonekanite (tiri ithuĩ... tiri ithuĩ) — kĩguni kĩa mũhoro gĩtigithĩkĩire."
    },
    {
      "kind": "addition",
      "subject": "no",
      "rationale": "Kĩngeranio gĩa kwaranĩria kĩhongore (תן nĩ kĩhooto kĩa kũheera) — Kĩhibirania kĩayarĩrire ha gĩkundĩ kĩu."
    },
    {
      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "gwĩtĩkĩra gwaku",
      "rationale": "אמת nĩ 'ũgĩkĩro\/gwĩtĩkĩka' — 'kwĩria' ti ũrĩa Kĩhibirania kiugĩte mũno."
    },
    {
      "kind": "invitation",
      "subject": "mabataro ma Yahwe",
      "rationale": "Mwandĩko ũyũ nĩ mahoya manjĩrĩirie magĩrĩirie Yahwe — kũhootana kwa gũthomwo ndũrĩrĩ-inĩ."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Tiri ithuĩ, Yahwe, tiri ithuĩ, no rĩĩtwa rwaku he utaũku, nĩ ũndũ wa hecedi waku na wa gwĩtĩkĩra gwaku.",
